 "description": "Audit a real response against what the OpenAPI document promises for that operation. Resolves the declared status exactly, by range such as 2XX, or through default, checks declared response headers are present, and validates the body against the declared schema for its media type. Catches an implementation that has drifted from its own published contract. Pay 140000 atomic USDC on Base via exact x402. MCP does not pay; it provides a challenge handoff.",
